<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Autosong second Client</Major>
    <Description>Button Q for Quickstep
Button S for Bloody chantey
Button D for  Bulwark Ballad
Button F for Ode to recovery 

They will start again after 13 to 16 sec randomly , just put the Alt in your Horse and he will play song all the night </Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 20 1
Delay 64 69 ms
KeyUp 20 1
Delay 2000 2500 ms
KeyDown 22 1
Delay 64 69 ms
